#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:387
#: 2c27cfc2e8ce47fb8732aec1e00d3479
msgid ""
"The public-key file next to the private key is re-derived from the "
"private key on every load: if it is missing or does not match the key in "
"use (a rotated ``~/.ssh/id_rsa``, a hand-edited pair) it is replaced, so "
"the exchanged public key always belongs to the private key that encrypts "
"and decrypts. An identical file is left untouched, which keeps a second "
"instance from replacing a file another process has open for reading "
"(Windows rejects ``os.replace`` with EACCES while a handle is open)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:394
#: 425ba3d582c3490b9375d99baa9b61e6
msgid ""
"A user-supplied keypair can be forced with ``is_custom_keys = "
"[pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]``: both files must exist, parse as PEM and "
"pair with each other (a probe encrypted with the public key must decrypt "
"with the private key); an invalid pair is ignored and the default lookup "
"is used."
msgstr ""
"사용자 제공 키 쌍은 ``is_custom_keys = [pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]``를 사용하여 강제할 수"
" 있습니다. 두 파일이 모두 존재해야 하며 PEM으로 구문 분석하고 서로 쌍을 이루어야 합니다(공개 키로 암호화된 프로브는 개인 "
"키로 해독해야 함). 유효하지 않은 쌍은 무시되고 기본 조회가 사용됩니다."

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:399
#: 696441cc5dd44fc4af958c547c8b6b90
msgid ""
"Public keys received from the server are cached in "
"``network_api/.Flow/pub_key`` as ``server_<ip>_<port>.pem`` (the server "
"endpoint the key came from; ``:`` is replaced with ``_`` so IPv6 literals"
" are safe on every platform, including Windows)."
msgstr ""
"서버에서 받은 공개 키는 ``network_api/.Flow/pub_key``에 ``server_<ip>_<port>.pem``으로"
" 캐시됩니다(키가 나온 서버 엔드포인트; ``:``는 ``_``으로 대체되므로 IPv6 리터럴은 Windows를 포함한 모든 "
"플랫폼에서 안전합니다)."

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:405
#: 2a81e756d1c947d384d20dbbbe5d6d52
msgid "Anti-MITM identity check (TOFU)"
msgstr "MITM 신원 확인(TOFU) 방지"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:407
#: 7a915eef76594c3ea715adb845fcabc6
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Every connection re-exchanges public keys in plaintext, and each side "
"records the peer in ``network_api/.Flow/pub_key/pub_key.json``: the "
"object key is the endpoint the peer is reachable at written as a string —"
" ``str((ip, port))``, e.g. ``\"('127.0.0.1', 65432)\"``, since JSON "
"object keys are strings — the value is ``[<sha256 of the public key PEM>,"
" <public key PEM>]``."
msgstr ""
"모든 연결은 공개 키를 일반 텍스트로 재교환하고 각 측은 "
"``network_api/.Flow/pub_key/pub_key.json``에 피어를 기록합니다. 키는 ``(ip, "
"port)``(피어가 도달할 수 있는 엔드포인트의 Python 튜플)이고 값은 ``[<공개 키의 sha256>, <공개 키 "
"PEM>]``입니다."

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:414
#: 4d56fbd290604113a600a56d8e89cdfb
msgid ""
"First connection from an endpoint: the key is recorded and trusted (trust"
" on first use)."
msgstr "엔드포인트에서의 첫 번째 연결: 키가 기록되고 신뢰됩니다(처음 사용할 때 신뢰)."

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:416
#: a6be8828e0594ddc8aa71229934cc73d
msgid ""
"Later connection presenting the *same* key: accepted. If the endpoint "
"changed (dynamic IP / user-changed port) the record is moved to the new "
"``(ip, port)`` instead of being duplicated."
msgstr ""
"*동일한* 키를 나타내는 나중에 연결: 허용됩니다. 엔드포인트가 변경된 경우(동적 IP / 사용자 변경 포트) 레코드가 중복되지 "
"않고 새로운 ``(ip, port)``로 이동됩니다."

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:419
#: fda350faac9a4efd82575a386fc929c0
msgid ""
"Later connection presenting a *different* key for an already-recorded "
"endpoint: the connection is rejected (``/crypto_reject`` is received and "
"the client closes)."
msgstr ""
"이미 기록된 엔드포인트에 대해 *다른* 키를 나타내는 이후 연결: 연결이 거부됩니다(``/crypto_reject``가 수신되고 "
"클라이언트가 닫힙니다)."

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:423
#: 9d62655e00324c518633c6c1d615d515
msgid ""
"The client-side record is keyed by the fixed server address, so a server "
"that changes its public key (for example a MITM substitution) is always "
"rejected on later connections. To reset trust (rotated keys, new server),"
" delete the ``pub_key.json`` entry (or the whole file)."
msgstr ""
"클라이언트 측 레코드는 고정 서버 주소로 입력되므로 공개 키(예: MITM 대체)를 변경하는 서버는 이후 연결에서 항상 거부됩니다."
" 신뢰를 재설정하려면(교체된 키, 새 서버) ``pub_key.json`` 항목(또는 전체 파일)을 삭제하세요."

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:429
#: 799c58ee59b0416688562166f58a14c1
msgid "Handshake"
msgstr "악수"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:431
#: 6f92afe3b8314a9985b62fe55cdeee70
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Right after connecting, the client announces its encryption mode with a "
"plaintext ``/crypto_mode <0|1>`` and waits up to 10 seconds for the "
"server's answer; a mode mismatch closes the connection. It then sends a "
"plaintext ``/crypto_key_exchange <client-nonce>`` greeting; the server "
"replies with ``/crypto_key_exchange_ack <server-nonce> <need-client-pub> "
"<force>``. Both (plaintext) and TOFU-check the received key. Both sides "
"switch to encrypted mode only after ``/crypto_ready`` has been received "
"from the peer (so plaintext and framed traffic never interleave on a "
"connection), then each announces frame readiness with a plaintext "
"``/crypto_frames_start`` and publishes its ephemeral session ECDH public "
"key as a ``/crypto_ecdh_pub`` line inside an RSA frame; frames are sent "
"only once both announcements have been seen. On later connections the "
"keys are re-exchanged and TOFU-checked again; the exchange is never "
"skipped, only the identity check short-circuits for known keys. Public-"
"key pushes are only accepted while a handshake is in progress, so an "
"arbitrary unauthenticated server cannot poison the registry."
msgstr ""
"클라이언트는 연결 직후 일반 텍스트 ``/crypto_key_exchange`` 인사말을 보냅니다. 서버는 "
"``/crypto_key_exchange_ack <need-client-pub> <force>``로 응답합니다. 그런 다음 양측은 "
"파일 전송 메커니즘(일반 텍스트)을 통해 공개 키 파일을 푸시하고 수신된 키를 TOFU 검사합니다. 양쪽 모두 "
"``/crypto_ready``가 피어로부터 수신된 후에만 암호화 모드로 전환됩니다(따라서 일반 텍스트와 암호 텍스트는 연결 시 "
"절대로 인터리브되지 않습니다). 이후 연결에서는 키가 다시 교환되고 TOFU가 다시 확인됩니다. 교환은 절대 건너뛰지 않으며, "
"알려진 키에 대한 신원 확인만 단락됩니다."

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:451
#: a501267a3c9848e6aac40eb13359da87
msgid "Replay protection"
msgstr "재생 보호"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:453
#: cde1f1712c904c89aa5838bc54c715b6
msgid ""
"The handshake exchanges a random session nonce, and every encrypted "
"message travels in a frame — ``magic | type (1) | body length (4) | "
"body`` with ``<sender-nonce>|<seq>|`` at the start of the body. Frame "
"type 1 carries a small text payload as chunked RSA-OAEP ciphertext (the "
"historic wire encoding); type 2 carries everything else, including all "
"binary and file data, as a ``pf_ecdh_seal`` blob (AES-256-GCM keyed by "
"the session's ephemeral ECDH keypair, with ``<nonce>|<seq>`` bound as "
"AAD). The receiver reads the type from the frame instead of inferring the"
" algorithm from the payload length, and sequence numbers are per socket "
"and cover both frame types. The receiver drops a frame whose nonce does "
"not match the current session (replayed from an older connection) or "
"whose sequence number is not the expected one (replayed within the "
"session / out of order); both counters reset when the socket flips to "
"encrypted mode after a (re-)exchange."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:469
#: 51478387b6dd4b2e9f7a3d10f72a8b90
msgid "Encrypted transfer connections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:471
#: a47f9db0c3674a12ab6d3ab5d056a8c4
msgid ""
"File and folder transfers, forwarded items and the forward relay run on "
"temporary TCP connections. The listening side stamps each leg with its "
"mode and a fresh nonce in the port advertisement "
"(``/server_file_transfer_port``, ``/forward_upload``); with "
"``is_enable_encrypto`` enabled both sides then frame that connection "
"exactly like the control channel, with the same session key material, so "
"file contents, names and sizes no longer cross the wire in the clear. The"
" public-key pushes themselves stay plaintext by construction: they carry "
"the keys the session is built on. A leg whose stamp promises encryption "
"is aborted when the session key material is not ready rather than "
"silently downgraded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:483
#: 6740137a28b84e5dbb3f85e8d58d32b5
msgid "Decode verification and key rotation"
msgstr "디코드 검증 및 키 순환"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:485
#: 8445bf9265124e38a642f9d46fc43c36
msgid ""
"Every encrypted plaintext carries the fixed suffix ``_VALID`` (separated "
"by ``_``). If a message cannot be decrypted, or the suffix is missing, "
"the socket drops out of encrypted mode, the local key is reloaded, and a "
"forced ``/crypto_key_exchange`` restarts the handshake so both sides re-"
"push their current public keys. The re-exchange itself re-runs the TOFU "
"check: a peer whose key did not change is accepted again, while a peer "
"presenting a *different* key for a recorded endpoint is rejected (see the"
" TOFU section above). A user who intentionally rotates a keypair must "
"delete the stale ``pub_key.json`` entry (or the whole file) on the peer "
"side to re-trust the new key."
msgstr ""
"모든 암호화된 일반 텍스트에는 고정 접미사 ``_VALID``(``_``로 구분)가 포함됩니다. 메시지를 해독할 수 없거나 접미사가"
" 누락된 경우 소켓은 암호화 모드에서 벗어나 로컬 키가 다시 로드되고 강제 ``/crypto_key_exchange``는 "
"핸드셰이크를 다시 시작하여 양쪽이 현재 공개 키를 다시 푸시하도록 합니다. 재교환 자체는 TOFU 검사를 다시 실행합니다. 키가 "
"변경되지 않은 피어는 다시 허용되는 반면, 기록된 엔드포인트에 대해 *다른* 키를 제시하는 피어는 거부됩니다(위의 TOFU 섹션 "
"참조). 의도적으로 키 쌍을 교체하는 사용자는 새 키를 다시 신뢰하기 위해 피어 측에서 오래된 ``pub_key.json`` "
"항목(또는 전체 파일)을 삭제해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:496
#: 5698fde8f08b4be3a059d92a69ae3459
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Re-exchanges are circuit-broken: after ``MAX_DECODE_FAILURES`` (3) "
"consecutive decode failures the connection is closed instead of re-"
"exchanging, so a garbage-injection or persistent-mismatch storm cannot "
"spin the loop forever. Genuine peer traffic (messages and commands other "
"than the protocol's own handshake/coordination lines) resets the counter."
" Frames the peer had already sent when this side dropped out of encrypted"
" mode are stale: they cannot be authenticated any more, so they are "
"consumed and dropped — they neither surface as messages nor reset the "
"counter."
msgstr ""
"재교환은 회로 차단됩니다. ``MAX_DECODE_FAILURES`` (3) 연속 디코드 실패 후 재교환 대신 연결이 닫히므로 "
"가비지 주입 또는 지속적인 불일치 폭풍으로 인해 루프가 영원히 회전할 수 없습니다. 암호 해독이 성공하면 카운터가 재설정됩니다."

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:508
#: 6569277ee0b644488685204e70c3e425
msgid "TCP Client command API"
msgstr "TCP 클라이언트 명령 API"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:510
#: b2ab9f46d6b14c8eaa97512fd117c6db
msgid ""
"The client supports both built-in commands that the user can type in the "
"console, and a command extension API similar to the server. The main "
"entry point for incoming server commands is `handle_server_command`, "
"while user-typed commands are processed in `interactive_mode`."
msgstr ""
"클라이언트는 사용자가 콘솔에 입력할 수 있는 내장 명령과 서버와 유사한 명령 확장 API를 모두 지원합니다. 들어오는 서버 명령의 "
"주요 진입점은 'handle_server_command'이며, 사용자가 입력한 명령은 'interactive_mode'에서 "
"처리됩니다."

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:516
#: 5e296796f3694cdfbf48c8538979bb7f
msgid ""
"The client supports two modes of operation: interactive console input "
"(when ``is_input_command_in_console`` is ``True``) or programmatic "
"control (when it is ``False``)."
msgstr ""
"클라이언트는 대화형 콘솔 입력(``is_input_command_in_console``이 ``True``인 경우) 또는 프로그래밍 "
"방식 제어(``False``인 경우)의 두 가지 작동 모드를 지원합니다."

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:520
#: 0261c3323c4248e3bfb846d5751da36f
msgid "Built-in client console commands (user-typed) include:"
msgstr "내장 클라이언트 콘솔 명령(사용자 입력)은 다음과 같습니다."

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:522
#: d466b066b3654e7183cf72f86523bcd1
msgid "``/quit``: sends a quit message to the server and closes the connection."
