"Any other non-empty line is sent as-is to the server — the same path chat"
" text takes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:666
#: d72b6516a43b4f26bb5750604f41ff74
msgid ""
"The client does not have a built-in ``/help`` command. Please refer to "
"the server's help for available commands (e.g., by typing ``/help`` after"
" connecting to the server)."
msgstr ""
"클라이언트에는 내장된 ``/help`` 명령이 없습니다. 사용 가능한 명령은 서버의 도움말을 참조하세요(예: 서버에 연결한 후 "
"``/help`` 입력)."

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:670
#: e6081a66251a4a57bc5724dccb8c852b
msgid ""
"A line registered with ``register_command(..., where_to_run=\"client\")``"
" runs when its first token matches a registered name; handlers registered"
" with ``where_to_run=\"server\"`` match the first token of the lines the "
"server sends."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:675
#: 4befe76529e04e859f9422d8ebe3921a
msgid ""
"*Note: The client logs ``Unknown server command: <line>`` for any line it"
" did not recognise, including plain chat text, because those lines take "
"the same fallback path.*"
msgstr ""

